# The extracted `btweb_only.ext4.gz` reference samples ARE committed to this repo
# by deliberate maintainer choice (so analysis / a fresh-clone session has them on
# hand). The binary-ignore rules for the BTicino images are therefore intentionally
# left DISABLED (commented out) below. Note these are proprietary BTicino images —
# anyone forking / redistributing should be aware. See README.md → "Redistribution & git".
#*.fwz
#*.gz
#*.ext4
#*.ext4.gz
# Still ignored: the uncompressed image (kept local) and the local mount point.
*.img
mnt/

# Always keep the structure and docs tracked.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!**/.gitkeep
